===Etymology===
{{dercat|bar|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=2}}
From {{inh|bar|gmh|wizzen}}, from {{inh|bar|goh|wizzan}}, from {{inh|bar|gmw-pro|*witan}}. Cognates include {{cog|de|wissen}} and {{cog|lb|wëssen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|bar|/ˈvisn̩/}}
* {{hyph|bar|wis|sen}}

===Verb===
{{head|bar|verb}}

# {{lb|bar|transitive}} to [[know]]
#* {{quote-text|bar|title=Wien wörtlich|section=Sieg der Provinz|year=1938|author=Josef Weinheber|text=I '''waaß''' net, es gibt so vü' Dichter in Wien,<br /> und ålle geehrt und berühmt.|t=I '''did'''n't '''know''' there were so many poets in Vienna,<br /> and all honorable and famous.}}

